00:11:39.000 --> 00:12:31.000
The local men retrieved firearms from their vehicles and to those who were unarmed raced to a nearby hardware store, buying out the store's stock of guns and ammunition. Chief Bedford, a veteran police officer who was tall and strong in stature, went to the front of the bank and directed his deputies to cover the back door. He was quickly joined by such a large number of armed citizens that the town's postmaster began marshalling them into an orderly line, brokering deals to split the loot if anyone made a kill. Inside the bank, Santa had finished loading up more than $12,000 in cash and started gathering up the checks, bonds and other valuables held within the vault, when suddenly a gunshot rang out.
当地男子从他们的车里取回枪械，没有武器的人则冲向附近的一家五金店，买光了该店的枪支和弹药库存。贝德福德局长是一名身材高大强壮的资深警官，他走到银行前门，指挥他的副手们守住后门。很快有大量武装市民加入他的行列，以至于镇上的邮政局长开始将他们编成整洁的队伍，并商量如果有人击毙匪徒就平分战利品。在银行内部，圣诞老人已经装好了超过12,000美元的现金，并开始收集金库里持有的支票、债券和其他贵族物品，突然一声枪响。

17
00:12:31.000 --> 00:13:22.000
Nobody was quite sure who fired the first shot or why, but it set off a chain reaction. Bullets flew from the street into the bank, ricocheting off walls and furniture. When a bullet struck one of the robbers through the front window, the four offenders quickly gathered the terrified customers and children around themselves and ushered their human shield towards the rear door. They emerged into the alleyway, exchanging gunfire with police as they went. Choosing two hostages to leave with them, 12-year-old Laverne Coma and 10-year-old Emma Mae Robertson, they made their way into their getaway vehicle that was parked nearby, a Navy Buick with wood trim, and sped off. Officer Reddy's corralled Cisco's man and boys
没有人能确定是谁开了第一枪，也不知道为什么，但这引发了一连串的反应。子弹从街上飞进银行，在墙壁和家具上反弹。当一颗子弹穿过前窗击中其中一名劫匪时，四名罪犯迅速将惊恐的顾客和儿童聚集在自己周围，并将他们的肉盾推向后门。他们出现在小巷里，一路上与警察交火。他们选择了两名人质带走——12岁的拉韦恩·科马（Laverne Coma）和10岁的埃玛·梅·罗伯逊（Emma Mae Robertson），坐上停在附近的一辆带木饰面的海军蓝别克逃跑车，疾驰而去。雷迪斯警官集结了思科的男人们和男孩们

