regularly. Santa's real name was Marshall Ratliff. Ratliff had been a troublemaker since childhood. He was spoiled by his mother who dismissed his misbehaviour as youthful hijinks, even when his actions led to him being expelled from school in the 9th grade. He went to work on a farm, plowing, howling, and pulling cotton, but quickly became resentful of the backbreaking work. He then joined forces with his older brother Lee and turned to the bootlegging business. Although Ratliff's reputation as a troublemaker preceded him, many couldn't help but be charmed by the 21-year-old's good looks, sense of humour, and impressive singing voice. His friends found him to be fun and generous and always happy to
经常去。圣诞老人的真名是马歇尔·拉特利夫（Marshall Ratliff）。拉特利夫从小就是一个令人头疼的麻烦制造者。他被母亲惯坏了，母亲将他的不良行为视为年轻人的恶作剧，甚至当他的行为导致他在9年级被学校开除时也是如此。他去农场工作，犁地、锄地、摘棉花，但很快就对这种繁重的体力劳动心生怨恨。后来，他与哥哥李（Lee）联手，转向了走私酒生意。尽管拉特利夫作为麻烦制造者的名声在外，但许多人还是被这个21岁年轻人出众的外表、幽默感和令人印象深刻的歌声所吸引。他的朋友们发现他既有趣又慷慨，总是乐于

